# Not excluded, and load-bearing: examples/. The 1988 archive lives outside this app
# (scripts/convert-all.py reads ~/GroundUp/Leela/git/lloooomm-imports/ties), its markdown
# output is committed here, and import.meta.glob reads that at build time. So the image
# builds from the committed corpus and never needs the originals or Python.
